[01:06.773]DAMIDAMIDAMIO~ River guides the way we roam
[01:10.595]哒咪哒咪哒咪哟~沿着河流
[01:10.595]When the night is gone, journey will carry on
[01:14.413]夜色消散，明日继续新的旅途
[01:14.413]To the secret untold, to the wonder we hold
[01:17.843]向着未言之秘，向着奇思妙想
[01:17.843]Running out the woods we know, little sheep we tip tap toe
